{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1540bccfc7a673ae391d3852023dae968378d0fae323d184fb1497505800f118", "ja": "（学園ドラマの撮影が始まった。麗花も、教師役で\n出演する事になったけど……何をしてるんだろう？）", "zh": "（校园剧的拍摄开始了。丽花也要出演教师一角，可是……她在做什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1001_p", "source_sha256": "789858a2f82830a9bf077aff7f8a18f815429d18dcd3ea5c6ba11f4a924bff5f", "ja": "おはよう、麗花。\nさっきから鏡の前で何をやってるんだ？", "zh": "早上好，丽花。\n你从刚才开始就一直在镜子前做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "a31eb90b1b1b348f7bc363c3ac59b599a246ab6c7ec94d8d3f65ded5726547bd", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん！\nもちろん、アクションシーンの練習ですよ！", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}先生！\n当然是在练习动作戏啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "bdcfae3be5d220e40f83b5bdd84c704ed0731af516176155073e1d61c194a4ff", "ja": "悪い大人や悪い先生、それからそれから悪い近所の人！\nそんな悪い人達から、大事な生徒を守っちゃいますよ♪", "zh": "坏大人、坏老师，还有还有坏邻居！\n我要保护重要的学生，不让他们受到那些坏人的伤害♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f504f79d9c85b21fad07bdac2bc51fa2a6bfd49adfcbe5b51849e31650dc87dd", "ja": "確かに、生徒と仲がいい先生役みたいだけど……\n今回のドラマに、アクションはなかったと思うな。", "zh": "确实，感觉像是和学生关系很好的老师……\n不过这次的剧里，应该没有动作戏吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "0fdc29a4e7025eb9df5fbec4887d229c459506bfa9eddb8410bc625acdb213f6", "ja": "えーっ、そうなんですか？　残念……。あと青春モノと\nいえば……あっ、わかりました！　走り込みですね♪", "zh": "诶——是这样吗？好遗憾……说到青春题材的话……啊，我明白了！是跑步训练吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "8ba3eac088a4f577a8dc75fb341722ced0285d3b133882ac8e72501f63f952ef", "ja": "青春学園ドラマは、夕日に向かって走るのが\n定番だって聞きました。私、足腰には自信があります♪", "zh": "听说青春校园剧里，迎着夕阳奔跑是固定桥段。我对自己的腿脚可是很有信心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9f30c470c0d7f70eb188c6dbb7d9e451aee605192d0db85f5d5ab225780bf0f8", "ja": "いや、そういうシーンもないと思うな……。\n麗花の役は、普通の新人教師だし。", "zh": "不，我想应该也没有那种镜头就是了……\n毕竟丽花演的只是个普通的新人教师啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "9f579b4a39c3c0b22fee4aab1666dea8e403fe5e6a11de0939f25e5b90b0b11c", "ja": "でもでも、撮影に体力は必要ですよね？\nアイドルのお仕事は、ハードな肉体労働ですし！", "zh": "但是但是，拍摄也需要体力吧？\n偶像的工作可是很辛苦的体力活！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0162_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0162_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "380c02cf7712b784913d68ea458aaa2810f64ff0e436648356ceb986d34ee2fa", "ja": "最後にものをいうのは体力……なんて。\nふふっ、なんだか青春ドラマの1ページみたいですね♪", "zh": "最终说话的还是体力……之类的。\n呵呵，感觉好像青春剧的第1页呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
